VIEWMODEL.md L15: `hidden: true` on a required field without a default is W1641; an optional field, a field with a default and `hidden: false` are fine.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local record Item {
  label: String
  note: String?
  count: Int = 0
  code: Int
}

view Item {
  label { hidden: true }
  note { hidden: true }
  count { hidden: true }
  code { hidden: false }
}
-- findings.txt --
warning[W1641]  a/a.canon:11:11
  required field label is hidden: new values cannot be completed in the studio

